  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge Hub Digital (Part II) and Support to Digital Investment Funds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The second phase of the Knowledge Hub Digital will keep providing specialised technical, operational and financial knowledge and analysis in support of the programming, identification, formulation and implementation of EU funded interventions, including with the private sector, cross the entire digital domain. It will support the scale up of Global Gateway by contributing to the development of a pipeline of investment projects.  A dedicated component will support the establishment of a mechanism providing support to innovative financial instruments promoting trusted, secure and resilient connectivity and fostering digital infrastructure investments.</narrative>
  </description>
